          "title": "《宋史》卷三百二十·呂溱傳",
          "source_bid": "d59f2gonq7sy",
          "details": "復修起居注。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "office_id": "hixi5uk9r9ca",
      "text": "翰林學士",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "《宋史》卷三百二十·呂溱傳",
          "source_bid": "d59f2gonq7sy",
          "details": "進知制誥，又出知杭州，入為翰林學士。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "office_id": "hixia8o5qz2b",
      "text": "知和州",
      "place_id": "hixicl85irz7",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "《宋史》卷三百二十·呂溱傳",
          "source_bid": "d59f2gonq7sy",
          "details": "帝知其過輕，但貶秩，知和州。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "office_id": "hixia8mzx69t",
      "text": "集賢院學士",
